        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Projects: Big Data, Underworld\n- People: Alan Wilkis, Karl Hyde, Rick Smith\n- Songs: \"Dangerous\"\n- Releases: \"1.0\", \"2.0\"\n- Places: Cardiff\n\nFacts:\n- Underworld are a British electronic group formed in 1980 in Cardiff.\n- Underworld is the principal name under which Karl Hyde and Rick Smith have recorded together.\n- Big Data is an American electronic music project created by producer Alan Wilkis.\n- \"Dangerous\" is a song by Big Data from the debut EP \"1.0\" released in 2013.\n- \"Dangerous\" is also included on Big Data's debut studio album \"2.0\" released in 2015.",
